{"ugly":[{"c":"An ugly man knocked on my door.","cn":"一个丑男人敲了我的门。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #73119 (CK) & #333234 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/73119"},{"c":"My house is old and ugly.","cn":"我的房子又舊又難看。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #250549 (CK) & #6678446 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/250549"}],"uk":[{"c":"UK is the abbreviation for the United Kingdom.","cn":"UK是英国的缩写。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1067763 (CM) & #2615108 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1067763"}],"ultimate":[{"c":"What is the ultimate purpose of education?","cn":"教育的最终目的是什么？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19127 (CK) & #487499 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19127"},{"c":"Our ultimate goal is to establish world peace.","cn":"我们的究极目标是树立世界和平。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #23432 (CK) & #6483612 (FAErika)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/23432"}],"ultrasound":[{"c":"I'd like you to have an ultrasound.","cn":"我想讓你接受超聲檢查。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #277979 (CM) & #6119443 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/277979"}],"ultraviolet":[{"c":"The ozone in the stratosphere absorbs ultraviolet radiation.","cn":"平流層的臭氧會吸收紫外線。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10540285 (sundown) & #6151835 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10540285"},{"c":"Ultraviolet rays can cause skin cancer.","cn":"紫外線可導致皮膚癌。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #263366 (CK) & #796940 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/263366"}],"umbrella":[{"c":"Did you bring an umbrella with you?","cn":"你有帶雨傘嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #245021 (CK) & #865584 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/245021"},{"c":"I have an umbrella in my car.","cn":"我的车里有伞。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5597080 (CK) & #5663392 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5597080"}],"umpire":[{"c":"I was asked to umpire the game.","cn":"我被要求當這場比賽的裁判。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #254396 (CK) & #881189 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/254396"}],"unable":[{"c":"He is unable to buy a car.","cn":"他不能买车。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #298495 (CK) & #8692916 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/298495"},{"c":"I am unable to finish my homework.","cn":"我無法完成我的作業。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1819532 (wyodoodoyw) & #884202 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1819532"}],"unanimous":[{"c":"The election was unanimous.","cn":"选举一致通过了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1538931 (SHamp) & #805192 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1538931"},{"c":"The vote is unanimous.","cn":"选举一致通过了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1241214 (xellugis) & #805192 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1241214"}],"unavoidable":[{"c":"What happened here was unavoidable.","cn":"發生這事是免不了的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3131621 (CK) & #5617219 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3131621"}],"unbearable":[{"c":"The pain is unbearable.","cn":"疼痛令人难以忍受。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1789071 (jonlam) & #336004 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1789071"}],"uncle":[{"c":"He asked me where my uncle lived.","cn":"他問我我的叔叔住在哪裡。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #288158 (CK) & #882995 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/288158"},{"c":"He was brought up by his uncle.","cn":"他被他的叔叔撫養長大。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289412 (CK) & #889107 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289412"}],"uncomfortable":[{"c":"I felt cold and uncomfortable the entire night.","cn":"我整個晚上覺得又冷又不舒服。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10276468 (DaoSeng) & #757562 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10276468"},{"c":"I'm very uncomfortable around children.","cn":"我被小孩围着非常不舒服。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5725402 (CM) & #9969103 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5725402"}],"unconscious":[{"c":"He was found lying unconscious on the kitchen floor.","cn":"他被人发现倒在厨房的地板上，不省人事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301193 (CK) & #343972 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301193"},{"c":"He was discovered unconscious on the floor of the kitchen.","cn":"他被人发现倒在厨房的地板上，不省人事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #383528 (Mouseneb) & #343972 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/383528"}],"uncontrollable":[{"c":"He has an uncontrollable temper.","cn":"他的脾氣不受控制。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #285858 (CK) & #13206405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/285858"}],"under":[{"c":"A new school building is under construction.","cn":"一座新的教学楼正在建设。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269145 (CK) & #10260791 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269145"},{"c":"All men are equal under the law.","cn":"法律之前人人平等。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321019 (CK) & #775462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321019"}],"underestimate":[{"c":"Don't underestimate your own strength.","cn":"不要低估自己的实力。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2396022 (CK) & #2581653 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2396022"},{"c":"Don't underestimate my power.","cn":"不要小看我的力量。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1461 (CK) & #335028 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1461"}],"underestimated":[{"c":"I've never underestimated Tom.","cn":"我从没低估汤姆。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2262055 (CK) & #5965707 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2262055"}],"underneath":[{"c":"I found the key underneath the mat.","cn":"我在擦鞋墊下面發現了這把鑰匙。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255674 (CK) & #805038 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255674"}],"understand":[{"c":"Few students could understand what he said.","cn":"很少有學生能了解他說的話。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #283596 (CK) & #875344 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/283596"},{"c":"He can't seem to understand that poem.","cn":"他似乎无法理解那首诗。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #291947 (CK) & #1454458 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/291947"}],"understanding":[{"c":"Tom and Mary came to an understanding.","cn":"汤姆和玛丽达成了协议。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4663879 (CK) & #10109525 (ColawithIce)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4663879"},{"c":"Mutual understanding promotes peace.","cn":"相互理解能促进和平。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #274110 (CM) & #5576762 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/274110"}],"underwater":[{"c":"Can you swim underwater?","cn":"你能潜水吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #270907 (CK) & #1776712 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/270907"}],"undo":[{"c":"I can't undo it.","cn":"我不能取消它。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #826005 (U2FS) & #827591 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/826005"}],"undone":[{"c":"Some things are better left undone.","cn":"有些事不做更好。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2069338 (halfb1t) & #6152992 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2069338"},{"c":"What is done cannot be undone.","cn":"覆水難收。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #20094 (Zifre) & #806229 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/20094"}],"uneasy":[{"c":"His letter makes me uneasy.","cn":"他的来信让我不安。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #286639 (Shiawase) & #1366057 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/286639"},{"c":"I understand that you feel uneasy, but don't worry.","cn":"我知道你不自在，但别急。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1316155 (CK) & #5640766 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1316155"}],"unemployed":[{"c":"I hear that the number of the unemployed has been increasing recently.","cn":"听说最近失业者人数正在增加","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264947 (CM) & #12475711 (a15997853561)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264947"}],"unemployment":[{"c":"The unemployment rate in Japan was 3.4 percent in September of 2015.","cn":"在2015年9月日本的失业率为3.4％。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4704215 (CK) & #9953272 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4704215"}],"unexpected":[{"c":"Do not fear the unexpected, but be prepared for it.","cn":"不要害怕意外，但要有準備。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #700114 (U2FS) & #881724 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/700114"},{"c":"That is rather unexpected.","cn":"这真是很意外。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1603 (CK) & #334163 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1603"}],"unforgettable":[{"c":"An unforgettable event occurred.","cn":"一场令人难忘的事件发生了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321127 (CM) & #335886 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321127"}],"unfortunately":[{"c":"Unfortunately, the telephone was out of order.","cn":"不幸的是電話壞了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26622 (CK) & #801468 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26622"},{"c":"Unfortunately, there was no one around.","cn":"很不幸，没有人在身边。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #71938 (CM) & #335544 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/71938"}],"unfounded":[{"c":"The rumors are unfounded.","cn":"謠言是毫無根據的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10176378 (ddnktr) & #781231 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10176378"}],"uniform":[{"c":"Tom changed into his uniform.","cn":"汤姆换上制服。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2643292 (CK) & #5780579 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2643292"},{"c":"Tom is wearing his uniform.","cn":"汤姆穿着他的制服。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6531407 (CK) & #13278117 (Enzo)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6531407"}],"unify":[{"c":"He tried to unify the various groups.","cn":"他試著統一不同的團體。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304511 (CK) & #881739 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304511"}],"union":[{"c":"The Cold War ended when the Soviet Union collapsed.","cn":"冷战以苏联解体结束。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #326069 (CK) & #6005574 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/326069"}],"unique":[{"c":"These flowers have a unique smell.","cn":"這些花有一種獨特的氣味。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #388322 (CK) & #869908 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/388322"}],"universal":[{"c":"English is a universal language and is used all over the world.","cn":"英語是一種世界性的語言，用於世界各地。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26276 (CK) & #811872 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26276"}],"universe":[{"c":"The universe is limitless.","cn":"宇宙浩瀚無邊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #928899 (CM) & #928900 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/928899"}],"university":[{"c":"He graduated from Harvard University with honors.","cn":"他光榮地從哈佛大學畢業了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304343 (CK) & #802097 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304343"},{"c":"He's a professor at the National University.","cn":"他是国立大学的一名教授。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2258573 (_undertoad) & #4473128 (yuiyu)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2258573"}],"unknown":[{"c":"The cause of the fire was unknown.","cn":"火災的原因不明。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #757941 (CK) & #757729 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/757941"},{"c":"The suspect's gender is currently unknown.","cn":"嫌疑犯目前性别不明。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10253678 (bekindtoall) & #10058497 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10253678"}],"unless":[{"c":"He did not speak unless spoken to.","cn":"除非有人跟他說話，他不說話。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304845 (CK) & #882536 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304845"},{"c":"Don't speak unless you have something worth saying.","cn":"除非你有什么值得说的话要说，否则就别吭声。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #239705 (CK) & #2017457 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/239705"}],"unlike":[{"c":"It's unlike him to get so angry.","cn":"这么生气不像他。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #66923 (CK) & #335498 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/66923"},{"c":"The crane, unlike the dog, has never dreamed of flying.","cn":"不像狗, 這隻鶴從來沒有夢想過飛翔。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #646792 (kebukebu) & #761304 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/646792"}],"unlikely":[{"c":"It's unlikely that he did anything wrong.","cn":"他看來沒有做錯甚麼。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #954102 (CK) & #6147581 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/954102"},{"c":"Tom is unlikely to do that again.","cn":"湯姆不太可能再那麼做了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6126550 (CK) & #6936208 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6126550"}],"unlock":[{"c":"What does this key unlock?","cn":"这钥匙能打开什么？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2049701 (CK) & #4844739 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2049701"}],"unnecessary":[{"c":"I believe this was unnecessary.","cn":"我相信這是不必要的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3818974 (CK) & #6138323 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3818974"},{"c":"If two men always have the same opinion, one of them is unnecessary.","cn":"如果两个人总是意见相同，那么他们其中一个就没必要了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1872 (Swift) & #502846 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1872"}],"unreasonable":[{"c":"There are always some people who are unreasonable.","cn":"总有一些人不讲理。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10372283 (DaoSeng) & #9990073 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10372283"}],"unsure":[{"c":"He was unsure how he would get there, and when.","cn":"他不知道怎么到那里去、什么时候到。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1070351 (witbrock) & #5617173 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1070351"}],"until":[{"c":"He did not appear until about noon.","cn":"直到快要中午前他都沒出現。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #301550 (CK) & #875296 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/301550"},{"c":"He waited for me until I arrived.","cn":"他等我直到我來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #246968 (CK) & #875286 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/246968"}],"unusual":[{"c":"The weather has been unusual this year.","cn":"今年的天氣一直異常。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #243171 (CK) & #907544 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/243171"},{"c":"I heard an unusual sound.","cn":"我聽到一個不尋常的聲音。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #321714 (CK) & #834607 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/321714"}],"unwise":[{"c":"I felt that the plan was unwise.","cn":"我覺得這計畫不是很聰明。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #254298 (CK) & #2511469 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/254298"},{"c":"She ignored him, which proved unwise.","cn":"她不理他，这被证明是不明智的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #316521 (CK) & #465891 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/316521"}],"up":[{"c":"Are you saying that you give up?","cn":"你是说你放弃了吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4811312 (khaledp16) & #4815166 (McMeao)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4811312"},{"c":"Be sure to pick up some milk.","cn":"務必要買一些牛奶。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #318236 (CK) & #798217 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/318236"}],"update":[{"c":"Tom needs to update his website.","cn":"汤姆需要更新他的网站。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1024398 (CK) & #5556063 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1024398"}],"updated":[{"c":"Please keep me updated.","cn":"請通知我。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2943141 (al_ex_an_der) & #918789 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2943141"},{"c":"Tom updated his website.","cn":"湯姆更新了網站。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #12749788 (Ergulis) & #13138997 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/12749788"}],"uphill":[{"c":"It was an uphill struggle.","cn":"这是个很艰难的斗争。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1226744 (PeterR) & #9958525 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1226744"}],"upon":[{"c":"A detective arrived upon the scene of the crime.","cn":"一名警探到达了犯罪现场。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #237816 (CM) & #1328076 (vicch)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/237816"},{"c":"Everything depends upon your decision.","cn":"所有事都取決於你的決定。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #51677 (CK) & #6065389 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/51677"}],"upset":[{"c":"I didn't mean to upset you.","cn":"我沒想要讓你難過。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2290421 (CK) & #13138183 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2290421"},{"c":"Don't get an upset stomach by eating too much.","cn":"不要因为吃得太多而扰乱胃的正常消化。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1554707 (CM) & #3580020 (CLARET)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1554707"}],"upside":[{"c":"She hung the picture upside down.","cn":"她把画挂反了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #311171 (CK) & #405752 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/311171"}],"upstairs":[{"c":"Go upstairs and bring down my trunk.","cn":"上樓把我的旅行箱拿下來。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #72895 (CK) & #798239 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/72895"},{"c":"My room is upstairs on the left.","cn":"我的房間在樓上的左邊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #251791 (CK) & #788842 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/251791"}],"urban":[{"c":"Traffic is a major urban problem.","cn":"交通是都市的一個主要問題。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #240309 (CM) & #786118 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/240309"},{"c":"More and more people are moving to urban areas.","cn":"越來越多的人遷往市區。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #32789 (CM) & #6325051 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/32789"}],"urge":[{"c":"Advertisements urge us to buy luxuries.","cn":"廣告慫恿我們買奢侈品。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #273148 (jakov) & #919907 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/273148"}],"urgent":[{"c":"There is an urgent message for you.","cn":"你有一個緊急的訊息。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #71071 (CK) & #907546 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/71071"},{"c":"There's an urgent need for medical supplies.","cn":"急需醫療用品。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2712618 (CK) & #6477573 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2712618"}],"us":[{"c":"All of us like you very much.","cn":"我们都非常喜欢你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #248305 (CM) & #510780 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/248305"},{"c":"Any one of us could do it.","cn":"我們之中任何一個都能做到。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #247367 (CK) & #798190 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/247367"}],"use":[{"c":"Do you know how to use this?","cn":"你知道怎么使用吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3408710 (CK) & #5715132 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3408710"},{"c":"He made good use of the money.","cn":"他好好的使用了​​這筆錢。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #290689 (CK) & #819238 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/290689"}],"used":[{"c":"He is used to getting up early.","cn":"他習慣早起。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300838 (CK) & #889109 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300838"},{"c":"He is used to speaking in public.","cn":"他習慣在公眾場合說話。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300169 (CK) & #846184 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300169"}],"useful":[{"c":"English is useful in diplomacy and tourism.","cn":"英語在外交和旅遊業方面很有用。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #26284 (CK) & #798318 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/26284"},{"c":"This knife was very useful to me.","cn":"這把刀對我來說很實用。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2415 (fcbond) & #13233798 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2415"}],"usual":[{"c":"He got up at five as usual.","cn":"他像往常一樣五點鐘起床。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289062 (CK) & #879195 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289062"},{"c":"It's a bit warmer today than usual.","cn":"今天相比往常，稍暖一些。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10910316 (sundown) & #12293672 (WangDusheng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10910316"}],"usually":[{"c":"Apples are usually green, yellow, or red.","cn":"蘋果通常是綠色、黃色或紅色。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2976130 (patgfisher) & #13539405 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2976130"},{"c":"Beef is usually more expensive than pork.","cn":"牛肉通常比豬肉貴。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9419040 (CK) & #13543760 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9419040"}],"utmost":[{"c":"This is a matter of the utmost importance.","cn":"这件事至关重要。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #55708 (sundown) & #332559 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/55708"}]}
